"Disco" gets its colorful nickname from its bright, metallic blue and orange color scheme, which looks shockingly un-stealthy at first glance. However, those vibrant panels are made from dynamic chameleon micro-tiles capable of shifting color instantly to reflect surrounding ambient light and textures. By bending light around the frame, "Disco" could make the suit nearly invisible to the naked eye while in motion.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXVII flies in with the rest of the Iron Legion during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis soldiers before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation.
